From: esp32-fx <local@esp32-fx.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] xtensa: reserve WAMR function and execution metadata

The compact fx module has more than 2300 functions. Its contiguous runtime
instance table exceeds 64 KiB and otherwise needs a 128 KiB buddy block.
Reserve that block at boot as well as the guest and response arenas. The
function table and execution environment share the bounded 128 KiB block.

--- a/arch/xtensa/boot/dts/esp32s3-reterminal-e1001.dts
+++ b/arch/xtensa/boot/dts/esp32s3-reterminal-e1001.dts
@@ -16,9 +16,9 @@
 		#size-cells = <1>;
 		ranges;
 
-		fx_wamr_arena: fx-wamr-arena@3def0000 {
-			/* 64 KiB native stream + 1 MiB guest linear memory. */
-			reg = <0x3def0000 0x00110000>;
+		fx_wamr_arena: fx-wamr-arena@3ded0000 {
+			/* 128 KiB metadata + 64 KiB stream + 1 MiB guest. */
+			reg = <0x3ded0000 0x00130000>;
 		};
 	};
 
